{"ref":"BDB, נִחוּם","hw":"נִחוּם","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">נִחוּם</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>comfort</em>, pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִחֻמִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.18\">Is 57:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:13\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.13\">Zc 1:13</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>compassion</em>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִחוּמָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 11:8\" href=\"/Hosea.11.8\">Ho 11:8</a> (We reads <span dir=\"rtl\">רַחֲמָ֑י</span>).","next":"BDB, נְחֶמְיָה","prev":"BDB, נְחוּם"}